{"id":"word:hebrew:H3708","type":"word","title":"כַּעַס","subtitle":"H3708 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"vexation","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to כַּעַס (H3708) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 25 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"כַּעַס (kaʻaç) means vexation First listed occurrence: 1Kgs 15 30."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"כַּעַס","transliteration":"kaʻaç","pronunciation":"kah'-as","strong":"H3708","lemmaId":"hebrew:H3708","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["כַּ֣עַס","בְּ/כַעְס֕/וֹ","הַ/כַּ֨עַס֙","כַּ֔עַס","וְ/כַעְסִ֖/י"],"morphs":[["HNcmsa",7],["HC/Ncmsa",3],["HR/Ncmsa",3],["HNcmsc",2],["HNcmsc/Sp2ms",2],["HR/Ncmsc/Sp3ms",1],["HTd/Ncmsa",1],["HC/Ncmsc/Sp1cs",1],["HTd/Ncmpa",1],["HR/Ncmsc",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"vexation","usage":"anger, angry, grief, indignation, provocation, provoking, × sore, sorrow, spite, wrath.","full":"H3708. ka 'ac כַּ֫עַס noun masculine vexation, anger ; — ׳כ Deut 32:27 13 t.; כָּ֑עַס Prov 21:19 ; Eccl 1:18 ; suffix כַּעְסִי 1Sam 1:16 , כַּעַסְךָ Psa 85:5 , כַּעְסוֺ Prov 12:16 ; 1Kin 15:30 ; plural כְּעָסִים 2Kin 23:26 . &#8212; vexation: 1 of men , especially caused by unmerited treatment, 1Sam 1:6 , 16 ; Prov 12:16 ; 17:25 ; 21:19 ; 27:3 ; Eccl 7:9 . 2 vexation, anger of Yahweh (caused especially by worship of other gods) 1Kin 15:30 ; 21:22 ; 2Kin 23:26 ; ׳כ עִמָּנוּ Psa 85:5 anger ( of Yahweh ) with us ; ׳כ בָּנָיו Deut 32:19 anger against his sons , ׳כ אוֺיֵב 32:27 anger against the enemy (both object Genitive see Di; RV provocation of , compare Dr); ׳כ קָרְבָּנָם Ezek 20:28 provocation of their offering (so RV but Co strike out, rightly). 3 vexation, grief Psa 6:8 ; 10:14 ; 31:10 ; Eccl 1:18 ; 2:23 ; 7:3 ; 11:10 , also כעס 5:16 accusative Ew aI. כַּ֫עַשׂ noun masculine (dialectic variation of כַּעַם , only in Job); &#8212; ׳כ Job 17:7 , כָּ֑עָשׂ 5:2 ; suffix כַּעְשִׂי 6:2 ; כַּעַשְׂךָ 10:17 ; &#8212; 1 vexation, grief of men Job 5:2 (compare Prov 12:16 ; 27:3 ), 6:2 ; 17:7 . 2 vexation, anger , of God; with עִמָּדִי כַּעַשְׂךָ Job 10:17 thine anger with me. כַּף see below כפף .","rootNote":"or (in Job) כַּעַשׂ ; from 3707 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Kgs 15 30","keyReferences":["1Kgs 15 30","1Kgs 21 22","1Sam 1 6","1Sam 1 16","2Kgs 23 26","Deut 32 19","Deut 32 27","Eccl 1 18"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":25,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Kgs 15 30","book":"1Kgs","chapter":15,"verse":30,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּ/כַעְס֕/וֹ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"1Kgs 21 22","book":"1Kgs","chapter":21,"verse":22,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/כַּ֨עַס֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"1Sam 1 6","book":"1Sam","chapter":1,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כַּ֔עַס","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"1Sam 1 16","book":"1Sam","chapter":1,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/כַעְסִ֖/י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmsc/Sp1cs"},{"reference":"2Kgs 23 26","book":"2Kgs","chapter":23,"verse":26,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/כְּעָסִ֔ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmpa"},{"reference":"Deut 32 19","book":"Deut","chapter":32,"verse":19,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִ/כַּ֥עַס","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsc"},{"reference":"Deut 32 27","book":"Deut","chapter":32,"verse":27,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כַּ֤עַס","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"Eccl 1 18","book":"Eccl","chapter":1,"verse":18,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כָּ֑עַס","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"Eccl 2 23","book":"Eccl","chapter":2,"verse":23,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וָ/כַ֨עַס֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"Eccl 7 3","book":"Eccl","chapter":7,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כַּ֖עַס","so